{"translation":{"id":"fra_jnd","name":"Bible J.N. Darby","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=frajnd","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=frajnd","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"JND","englishName":"French: Bible J.N. Darby","language":"fra","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"121a3f4841e42965f22ebebcf5a8578a12578ec30eaf1ca7ae4e46d5d85ccb80","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/fra_jnd/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31170,"languageName":"français","languageEnglishName":"French"},"book":{"id":"PSA","translationId":"fra_jnd","name":"Les Psaumes","commonName":"Les Psaumes","title":"Les Psaumes","order":19,"numberOfChapters":150,"sha256":"4c48a766d24644f7ef347ae1395ef8ddb5d363cc30acf1733162d22f071b120e","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/fra_jnd/PSA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":150,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/fra_jnd/PSA/150.json","totalNumberOfVerses":2527},"chapter":{"number":43,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"Juge-moi, ô Dieu ! et prends en main ma cause contre une nation sans piété","poem":1},{"noteId":117},{"text":"; délivre-moi de l’homme trompeur et inique.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Car toi, ô Dieu ! tu es ma force","poem":1},{"noteId":118},{"text":"; pourquoi m’as-tu rejeté ? Pourquoi marché-je en deuil à cause de l’oppression de l’ennemi ?","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Envoie ta lumière et ta vérité : elles me conduiront, elles m’amèneront à ta montagne sainte et à tes demeures.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Et je viendrai à l’autel de Dieu, au ✶Dieu de l’allégresse de ma joie ; et je te célébrerai sur la harpe, ô Dieu, mon Dieu !","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Pourquoi es-tu abattue, mon âme ? et pourquoi es-tu agitée au-dedans de moi ? Attends-toi à Dieu ; car je le célébrerai encore : il est le salut de ma face et mon Dieu.","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":117,"caller":"a","text":"ailleurs : bonté.","reference":{"chapter":43,"verse":1}},{"noteId":118,"caller":"b","text":"litt. : Dieu de ma force.","reference":{"chapter":43,"verse":2}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/fra_jnd/PSA/43.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/fra_jnd/PSA/44.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/fra_jnd/PSA/42.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":5}